course: dictionary
lesson: 15663
title: Thirtieth: place and part
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some numbers tell you a place in a line. «Sam came twenty-ninth in the race, so Mia came thirtieth.» Thirtieth means number 30 in order, and it is written 30th.
explain: Thirtieth can also name a part. One thirtieth means one of thirty equal parts, written 1/30. If a cake is cut into thirty equal slices, each slice is one thirtieth of the cake.
explain: Ask yourself: is the word showing a place in order, or a share of something? «Her party is on the thirtieth of May» uses it for a date, a place in the order of the days of the month. The words around it give you the clue.
fact: Thirtieth is an ordinal number: it tells you the place in order, like first, second and third.
fact: 30th is the short way to write thirtieth.
fact: One thirtieth means one of thirty equal parts, and it is written 1/30.
fact: «My thirtieth birthday» means the birthday that comes after your twenty-ninth birthday.
fact: As a noun, «a thirtieth» means one equal part out of thirty.
exercise: «Lily came thirtieth in the spelling test.» What place is that? | *30th | 29th | 13th | 31st
exercise: If a pizza is cut into thirty equal slices, what fraction is one slice? | 30/1 | 1/3 | 1/10 | *1/30
exercise: Which number is the same as thirtieth? | 300th | 13th | *30th | 3rd
test: «Ava sat in the twenty-ninth seat, so the thirtieth seat is next to her.» What number is the thirtieth seat, written in digits? | *30 | 29 | 3 | 31
test: What is one thirtieth written as a fraction? | 30/1 | *1/30 | 1/10 | 1/3
exam: «The party is on the thirtieth of May.» Which is the correct short way to write the date? | *30th of May | 3th of May | 13th of May | 30st of May
